    "This revision-3 recipe proposal is based on the actual approved game 0.6.10 recipes; it is not implemented or approved.",
    "Rank-I basics normally lead only to their own Basic champion; the hard maximum is two distinct output recipes. Blacksmith I and Stormspear I are the two named second-output exceptions across the factions.",
    "All Basic main families remain rank I, with support ingredients at rank II except the named rank-I exceptions. Intermediate directly added basics use II–IV and Advanced directly added basics use II–V.",
    "TOP recipes remain Advanced + VI + VI. Existing branch families, champion predecessor links, exact selected rank corrections and the Mortar Dwarf terminal-pool exception are preserved.",
    "Every basic rank has at least one and at most three successor recipes; a strict majority of higher ranks have exactly two. Material changes require later acquisition and balance testing."
